            "text": "Based on my training knowledge, Oslo, Norway typically experiences cool autumn weather in October. Average temperatures are roughly:\n\n- **Daytime highs:** around **8–10°C (46–50°F)**\n- **Nighttime lows:** around **2–4°C (36–39°F)**\n\nOctober in Oslo is generally chilly, often rainy, and can occasionally see the first light snowfall toward the end of the month. It's advisable to wear warm layers if visiting during that time.\n\nWould you like me to check the **current weather** in Oslo using real-time data?",
            "type": "output_text"
          }
        ],
